DESCRIPTION:Event by Seneca Lake Wine Trail\nPublic\nOver seven days – A
 ugust 21-28\, 2026 – passholders can enjoy visiting and sampling wines a
 t participating wineries\, during each winery’s regular business hours.
 \nYour pass includes wine tasting\, dog biscuits\, and a special souvenir 
 bandana for your dog!\nYou can come for a day or two\, or spread your visi
 ts out over the entire event duration (your pass entitles you to one tasti
 ng at each winery).\n$50 per tasting pass including taxes and fees. Passes
  are non-refundable. Ticket insurance is available\, for an extra fee at c
 heckout via our third party partner.\nOne pass = one complimentary tasting
  flight poured at each winery.\nYou must be traveling with a dog to purcha
 se this tasting pass.\nClick HERE for More Info!!!\nTickets: https://senec
 alakewine.com/event/gone-to-the-dogs/?fbclid=IwY2xjawS1NzNleHRuA2FlbQIxMAB
