CATEGORIES:Causes,Sports
DESCRIPTION:Event by The Arc Allegany-Steuben and Paula Bernstein\nWellsvi
 lle Country Club & Restaurant\n590 N Main St\, Wellsville\, NY\nPublic\nJo
 in the Friends of Allegany Arc Foundation for our annual Summer Scramble G
 olf Tournament on Friday\, August 21st\, with a 1:30 p.m. shotgun start at
  the Wellsville Country Club!\nGather your team for a fun afternoon on the
  course. The tournament features a traditional four-person scramble with m
 en’s\, women’s\, and mixed teams welcome\, multiple prize holes\, and 
 an exciting chance to win $10\,000!\nThis event is open to the public\, so
  invite your friends\, family\, and fellow golf enthusiasts. Proceeds will
  benefit the Friends of Allegany Arc Foundation and support important prog
 rams and services in our community.\nRegister today by visiting:\nwww.char
 itygolftoday.com/friendsgolf26\nWe hope you’ll join us for a great day o
 f golf while supporting an incredible cause!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - http
 s://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78407196/20260821130000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78407196/20260821130000
