 ’t already a member of the Friends of the Library\, you can join at the 
 door: $5 for an individual and $10 for families.\nThe full sale schedule i
 s as follows:\nSaturday\, August 22 – 9:00 AM – 4:00 PM\, Members only
 . This is the best day to look for those rare finds!\nSunday\, August 23 
 – Noon – 5:00 PM\, Open to the public.\nMonday\, August 24– Thursday
 \, August 27 – 9:00 AM -7:00 PM\, Open to the public.\nFriday\, August 2
 8 – 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM\, Open to the public.\nSaturday\, August 29 – 
 9:00 AM – 2:00 PM\, Open to the public. This is box and bag day: $5 and 
 up for a box or bag (depending on the size).\nCash or check only. No credi
 t cards accepted. The Friends of the Library are required to collect NY St
 ate sales tax\; if you have a tax-exempt form please bring it\, as we must
  charge tax without it.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/
