CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Film
DESCRIPTION:CatVideoFst 2026\nSun Aug 23rd 3:00pm - 4:30pm\nThe Smith Oper
 a House\, 82 Seneca Street\, Geneva\, NY 14456\, USA\n“Watching silly ca
 t videos is good for you.” — The Wall Street Journal\nOscilloscope Lab
 oratories presents CatVideoFest 2026\, a compilation of the latest and bes
 t cat videos culled from countless hours of unique submissions and sourced
  animations\, music videos\, and classic internet powerhouses. Each year\,
  across the country\, local theaters partner with nearby cat-focused chari
 ties\, animal welfare associations and shelters alike — a portion of tic
 ket proceeds from every show goes directly to local cats in need.\nMovies 
 at The Smith aren't just a film screening\, they are an event! We love cos
 tumes because they are FUN and we encourage you to wear cat ears\, tails\,
  or other feline-themed garb! Remember to stop by Concessions in our beaut
 iful lobby to purchase your fresh\, delicious popcorn\, and be sure to cat
 ch the vintage cartoon short screening before our feature film!\nWant to s
 ee your cat on the big screen before the movie? Send a photo to agentry@th
 esmith.org by 5pm Tuesday\, August 18 with the subject line “CatVideoFes
 t 2026”\nRuntime: 70 minutes\nRated G\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://c
 alendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78418747/20260823150000
GEO:42.867123;-76.984018
LOCATION:The Smith Opera House\, 82 Seneca Street\, Geneva\, New York\, 14
 456\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78418747/20260823150000
END:VEVENT
