BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Camp Scampi - Music\, Food & Arts Festival!
DTSTART:20260827T160000Z
DTEND:20260830T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T093939Z
UID:b8f5f9fe7251f03755b0acf3b7000d17d1b9a09c@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music,Festivals,Art,Food
DESCRIPTION:Event by Camp Scampi\, Noetika and 6 others\n7222 NY-417\, Add
 ison\, NY\nPublic\nBig Shrimp\, in coordination with Sage Entertainment & 
 Moe Town\, is thrilled to announce the inaugural lineup for Camp Scampi\, 
 a three-stage Music\, Food\, & Arts festival taking place August 28th & 29
 th at Moe Town Music Venue in Addison\, NY.\n2-Day Passes and more info\, 
 now available at https://www.campscampifest.com\nWe’re beyond excited to
  present two nights and four sets of Big Shrimp\, alongside an incredible 
 lineup of artists including Spafford\, Space Bacon\, Jimkata\, Tand\, Musc
 le Tough\, and many more. Representing the Northeast’s jamgrass communit
 y\, we’re proud to feature The Dirty Grass Players and Folkfaces.\nOur c
 ampground area will host a Renegade EDM stage running all weekend long\, h
 eadlined by a special Saturday late-night set from Denver's Noetika\, plus
  a lineup of talented DJs. Music on the Main Stage & EDM Stage will run un
 til at least 2AM each night.\nWe’re excited to partner with the online c
 ommunity You Enjoy MyFood to bring food-focused activities to the campgrou
 nds all weekend long\, channeling the spirit of Phish’s MondeGreen festi
 val in Pod 8.\nArt installations will be curated by the incredible Kozmik 
 Sirkus Productions\, known for Big Shrimp's annual Halloween Extravaganza 
 productions\, while Sonic Odyssey Productions will be providing top-tier s
 ound\, lighting\, and visual production.\nOur mission\, It’s As Shrimple
  As That: Bring festivals back to what made them special in the first plac
 e—community\, companionship\, and the power of live music. No unnecessar
 y barriers. No cash-grab culture. Just a shared space where people can unp
 lug\, come together\, and be part of something real.\nNo VIP tiers here—
 because at Camp Scampi\, everyone is a Very Important Prawn Star.\nCamp Sc
 ampi is a two-day affordable event\, and we believe a festival in 2026 can
  be done like it was in 1996 (yes\, before we were born)\, and bring it ba
 ck to the way it used to feel: free-spirited\, affordable\, and built arou
 nd genuine human connection. It’s Big Shrimp’s gigantic end of Summer 
 party\, and EVERYONE is invited!\nThis is Camp Scampi.\nTickets: https://t
