DESCRIPTION:Event by Metasequoiamusic LLC and The Cherry Arts\nThe Cherry 
 Arts\nDuration: 4 hr\nPublic\nWe’re hosting our first Gear Exchange at T
 he Cherry Arts Space.\nHave old gear laying around?\nNeed to declutter you
 r studio?\nLooking for a unique instrument?\nThis is a community event ope
 n to the public.\nWe will have tables set up for those looking to unload l
