BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Eleven Lakes\, Endless Stories: Book Club
DTSTART:20260901T213000Z
DTEND:20260901T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T093939Z
UID:c0f02d494c0934721868e0df1fd3dff70480e2a5@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Literature
DESCRIPTION:Event by Saunders Finger Lakes Museum\n3369 Guyanoga Road\, Br
 anchport\, NY\nPublic\nCalling all book lovers in the Finger Lakes region!
  Whether you’re a lifelong reader or just getting back into the habit\, 
 our cozy book club is the perfect place to connect\, relax\, and dive into
  great stories together. Come share books\, conversation\, and connection
 \, while enjoying snacks and a glass of Finger Lakes wine. All of the book
 s we read and discuss will have a Finger Lakes connection – topic\, auth
 or\, and/or setting.\nFor our September book club meeting\, we will be rea
 ding Amidst the Stones of Celtic Ireland by Jeanne Crane. Jeanne is a Fing
 er Lakes local and will be leading this book club meeting! Find the link t
 o the book\, information about the author\, and a brief introduction to th
 e book below:\nAmidst the Stones of Celtic Ireland – Amazon\nAbout the A
 uthor – Jeanne Crane\nAbby and Mark want the freedom to explore their ne
 w relationship away from the watchful eyes of family and neighbors. He is 
 fascinated by lighthouses and she is drawn to ancient Celtic stone circles
 . They embark on a road trip around the coast of Southwest Ireland that ta
 kes them into mystical and magical experiences far beyond their planned it
 inerary. Messages from Abby’s past\, even perhaps past lives\, greet the
 m as they visit stone circles\, ancient Celtic church ruins and ponder the
  role of the Mother/Divine Feminine in ancient religion\, local myth and h
 istory\, and early Christianity. Jeanne Crane’s love of Ireland is infec
 tious\, her extensive travel experience informative and the characters she
  has created are endearing and authentic.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https:/
 /calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78441667/20260901173000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78441667/20260901173000
END:VEVENT
