 0 PM for a mid-week tradition that brings the community together all summe
 r long.\nOpening Day: Wednesday\, June 3\nEvery Wednesday | June 3 – Sep
 tember 30 | 10:00 AM – 2:00 PM\nWisner Park\, Elmira NY\nBrowse more tha
 n 30 vendors offering fresh produce\, cut flowers\, handmade crafts\, uniq
 ue local goods\, and more. Grab lunch from some of the best food trucks an
 d local restaurants in the area\, enjoy live music\, and soak up everythin
 g that makes downtown Elmira special.\nLive Music Sponsored by Southern Ti
 er Custom Fabricators\nGood vibes and great tunes are on the playlist ever
 y week. Pull up a seat and enjoy live performances throughout the market.
 \nStory Time at the Market Presented by Farm Credit East and Gannon Associ
 ates Insurance\nNew This Year: More to Come! We're adding exciting new pro
 gramming to the 2026 season. Stay tuned for announcements you won't want t
 o miss what's in store. ~ Sponsored by SerVU Credit Union\nVisit elmiradow
 ntown.com for updates\, vendor info\, and more.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - h
