SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Farmers Market,Community,Food,Crafts,New to the Area,Family Fun
DESCRIPTION:Corning Farmers Market\nFresh\, local\, and better than ever
 —the Corning Farmers Market is back and expanding for the season!\nJoin 
 us in downtown Corning each week to shop a wide variety of local produce\,
  baked goods\, handmade items\, and more from your favorite vendors. This 
 year\, we’re growing the market experience with additional vendors and f
 ood trucks around the Clock Tower\, bringing even more flavor\, variety\, 
 and energy to Market Street!\nThursdays\, June 4th through October 29th\n1
 0:00 AM – 2:00 PM\nDowntown Corning (Riverfront Centennial Park)\nMore w
 ays to shop:\nCustomers can use eWIC and SNAP benefits\, and we’re excit
 ed to offer Double Up Food Bucks (DUFBNY) again this year—helping you ge
 t even more fresh\, healthy food while supporting local vendors! (Some lim
 itations may apply)\nCome stroll\, shop\, and support local while enjoying
  the vibrant atmosphere of downtown Corning. There’s something for every
 one at the Farmers Market!\nImportant Update:\nWith the market expansion\,
  the Tioga Ave entrance side of the parking garage will be closed on Thurs
 days to accommodate vendors and ensure a safe\, enjoyable experience for a
 ll attendees. Please plan accordingly when visiting the market.\nA huge th
 ank you to our Summer in Downtown sponsor Williams Toyota!\n\nSource: Corn
 ing Area Chamber of Commerce - https://www.corningny.com/events/details/co
 rning-farmers-market-09-03-2026-19773
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.corningny.com/events/details/corning-farmers-market-09-03-
 2026-19773
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Montour Falls Farmers Market
DTSTART:20260903T200000Z
DTEND:20260903T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T093939Z
UID:bbd5cb4da28cdff8c0cad053c05fe7c8a799e152@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Farmers Market,Food,Crafts,Family Fun,New to the Area
DESCRIPTION:Vendor attendance will vary and is subject to change. Please c
 heck Facebook & Instagram for the latest updates including cancellations d
 ue to inclement weather and new vendor announcements. Contact vendors dire
 ctly for product availability.\nThe Montour Falls Farmers Market\, in coor
 dination with the Village of Montour Falls and the Montour Falls Fire Depa
 rtment\, supports a close-knit community by providing a place for farmers
 \, small businesses\, artisans\, and organizations to offer their products
 \, talents\, and resources. Our goal is to provide a space to shop local\,
  socialize\, and explore our community with a sustainable approach.\nMFFM 
 began in 2016 with the mission of providing fresh\, locally sourced food t
 o Montour Falls residents and creating a place for farmers to sell their p
 roducts in Schuyler County. Upon reaching that goal\, we increased our mis
 sion to include a space for socializing\, entertainment\, and education in
  an accessible\, welcoming outdoor location. The Montour Falls Farmers Mar
 ket supports local farms and small businesses\, and encourages the use of 
 SNAP/EBT.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event
 /78366788/20260611160000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78366788/20260611160000
END:VEVENT
