BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trivia Under the Tent: Back to School Edition
DTSTART:20260904T230000Z
DTEND:20260905T035959Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T093939Z
UID:0798952c570959ae088506f054e6c9ce53601383@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Games,Competitions
DESCRIPTION:Trivia Under the Tent: Back to School Edition\nWith Local triv
 ia host Bob Proehl!\nFriday\, September 4 from 7–9 pm\nTickets: $100 tea
 m (up to 6) / $20 individual\nJoin us for a fun and friendly Trivia Night 
 to raise funds for the Hangar Theatre’s KIDDSTUFF Series! Gather your fr
 iends (or come on your own!)\, test your knowledge\, and compete for Hanga
 r-themed prizes—all while supporting the Hangar’s mission to bring out
 standing Theatre for Young Audiences to our community. Whether you’re a 
 trivia buff or just in it for a good time\, this is a night you won’t wa
 nt to miss.\nThis is a family-friendly event that will include both genera
 l knowledge (pop culture\, sports\, history\, music) and some theater-rela
 ted trivia. We’ll have a cash bar with wine\, beer\, and non-alcoholic b
 everages as well as sweet and snacky items to keep you sharp and on the ba
 ll.\nAll proceeds go to benefit the Hangar Theatre’s KIDDSTUFF series!\n
 Trivia Night FAQs:\n1. How do I register as a team?\nPurchase a team ticke
 t ($100) to register your team of up to 6 people. Within 48 hours of purch
 asing your ticket\, you will receive a google form by email that will let 
 you submit a team name (if you have one!) as well as the names of your tea
 m members.\n2. Can I register as an individual?\nAbsolutely! Purchase an i
 ndividual ticket ($20) to register as an individual\, and we will match yo
 u with a team. Within 48 hours of purchasing your ticket\, you will receiv
 e a google form by email that will let you submit any team requests (for e
 xample\, you and a friend could purchase individual tickets and request to
  be on the same team.)\n3. How does it work?\nAll teams will get asked the
  same question\, read aloud by emcee Bob Proehl. Players will work within 
 their teams to come up with an answer\, write it down\, and submit. All qu
 estions are about a variety of topics including general knowledge and thea
 ter-related trivia. Some questions will be multiple choice\, others will b
 e fill in the blank.\n4. How does a team win?\nThe team with most points a
 t the end of the game are our winners!\nTickets: https://hangartheatre.eas
 y-ware-ticketing.com/eventsByMovie/A000001105.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - ht
 tps://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78440339/20260904190000
GEO:42.457531;-76.515267
LOCATION:Hangar Theatre\, 801 Taughannock Boulevard\, Ithaca\, New York\, 
 14850\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://hangartheatre.easy-ware-ticketing.com/eventsByMovie/A000001105
END:VEVENT
