 pker Sisters are an intoxicating blend of intricate harmonies with the sop
 histication of jazz\, the soul of R&B mixed with Latin and good old rock a
 nd roll. They bring their unique style to everything they do. Be it the Gr
 eat American Songbook\, an R&B classic\, or one of their infectious origin
 als\, they never forget .... "it don't mean a thing if it ain't got that s
 wing"!\nGeneva Lakefront Concert Series is held outside at the pavilion al
 ong Seneca Lake next to the Finger Lakes Welcome Center. Please bring a ch
 air or blanket. Food and drinks will be available for purchase from area f
 ood vendors.\nSponsored by: Geneva Community Projects\n\nSource: FLXcalend
