DESCRIPTION:Event by Atwater Wine\n5055 State Route 414\, Burdett\, NY\nDu
 ration: 3 hr\nPublic\nHannah T is a songwriter and multi-instrumentalist\,
  newly arrived in Ithaca from Gainesville\, FL where she spent the last 5 
 years performing with her bands Tamayo (funk rock) and Estro (alt-indie). 
 Her personal songwriting taps into her experience and emotions as a twenty
 -something trying to make sense of the world\, navigate relationships\, an
 d reflect on the craziness of constantly moving between her life in the U.
 S. and her life doing anthropology fieldwork in the mountains of rural Lat
 in America. Blending indie\, alt-rock\, and folk genres\, Hannah's songs a
 re catchy\, honest\, and tell stories that folks from all walks of life ca
 n relate to.\nPlease join us for Hannah's music\, wine by the glass or bot
 tle\, cocktails\, mocktails\, cheese\, vegan\, or charcuterie plates\, and
  small bites.\nIndustry and Club Discounts!\nMusic 6:00-8:00\nOpen until 9
 :00\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78441
 633/20260910180000
