SUMMARY:Jeff Tweedy Solo LIVE @ State Theatre of Ithaca
DTSTART:20261024T233000Z
DTEND:20261025T035959Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T093939Z
UID:5a441da18a9f7fe4b84bc31c893cb1413fadd26f@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music,Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Event by State Theatre of Ithaca\, Jeff Tweedy and DSP Shows\n
 State Theatre of Ithaca\nPublic\nDSP Shows & The State Theatre of Ithaca P
 resent:\nJeff Tweedy Solo\nwith special guest Case Oats\nSaturday\, Octobe
 r 24th\, 2026\nDoors: 6:30pm | Show: 7:30pm\nTickets: https://tixr.com/e/1
 93670\nJeff Tweedy\nA special solo show with Jeff Tweedy\, founding member
  and frontman of Wilco and one of contemporary music’s most respected so
 ngwriters and performers. In addition to 13 Wilco albums\, he has released
  five solo albums – most recently\, his 30-track “magnum opus” (New 
 York Times) Twilight Override. A rare chance to experience songs from acro
 ss his expansive catalog and step inside the world of Twilight Override.\n
 -----\nCase Oats\nCase Oats is the Chicago outfit led by Casey Gomez Walke
 r and Spencer Tweedy.\nCase Oats began life seven years ago when Gomez Wal
 ker\, a writer and poet with some experience in bands\, met Tweedy\, a sea
 soned drummer who has performed with Jeff Tweedy\, Waxahatchee\, Mavis Sta
 ples\, and Norah Jones. Not long after meeting\, they started writing song
 s together\, and in the time since their formation\, Case Oats have homed 
 in on a lived-in sound that perfectly complements Gomez Walker’s lyrics 
 which are wry and confessional and full-bodied.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - h
 ttps://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78439079/20261024193000
GEO:42.439256;-76.499593
LOCATION:State Theatre of Ithaca\, 107 West State Street\, Ithaca\, New Yo
 rk\, 14850\, United States
