DESCRIPTION:Concert at 144 Cedar Street\, Corning\nIn the red-brick UM Chu
 rch–door on First St.\nGet ready to stomp your feet\, laugh\, cry\, and 
 hear sounds you’ve never heard before with this electrifying chamber-fol
 k band. Wielding forgotten fiddles that would turn classical music scholar
 s to stone\, these four folk musicians are reimagining the Western String 
 Quartet. By inviting back instrumental voices previously regarded as too u
 gly for “polite society” Medusa tempts us to redefine what is beautifu
 l.\nClick here for tickets\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.
 ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78437350/20261108140000
